## Statistical Measures
| Measure | Formula | What it tells you |
|---------|---------|-------------------|
| **Slope (m)** | Σ((x-̄x)(y-ȳ)) / Σ(x-̄x)² | Rate of change in y per unit x |
| **Intercept (b)** | ȳ - m×̄x | Expected y when x = 0 |
| **R²** | 1 - (SS_res / SS_tot) | Proportion of variance explained |

